Sun Oct 18 05:57:59 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 1.5.9 (includes 1.5.8 changes):
  * Experimental AOMedia Polygonal Mesh Coding (PMC) in glTF and
    the draco_transcoder tool (off by default)
  * New supported glTF extensions: KHR_materials_emissive_strength,
    KHR_materials_iridescence, KHR_materials_anisotropy,
    KHR_materials_diffuse_transmission, KHR_animation_pointer,
    KHR_interactivity
  * Read big-endian binary PLY files; signed integer attribute
    types and normalized attributes in glTF; unlimited texture
    coordinate attributes
  * Security hardening (no CVE IDs assigned upstream): bounds
    checks in mesh prediction scheme and sequential mesh decoders,
    the rANS entropy decoder and the STL/PLY/OBJ readers against
    crafted-file heap over-reads
  * 1.5.9 additionally fixes the JavaScript/WASM decoder builds
- Drop draco-gcc15.patch, fixed upstream
- Rebase disable-static-library.patch for the PMC-aware shared
  library block
- Soname 9 -> 11: rename libdraco9 subpackage to libdraco11
- Spec cleanup: drop Group tags, use %ldconfig_scriptlets

